  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Boosted_Brightness_Remastered/BH_Boosted_Brightness_Remastered_header.webp\" alt=\"Header\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Boosted_Brightness_Remastered/BH_Boosted_Brightness_Remastered_description.webp\" alt=\"Description\"></p>\n<p><strong>這是 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/boosted-brightness\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Boosted Brightness</a> 的非官方移植版</strong></p>\n<p>Boosted Brightness 是一款簡單的模組，允許您將亮度設定超過預設值。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Boosted_Brightness_Remastered/BH_Boosted_Brightness_Remastered_features.webp\" alt=\"Features\"> 修改過的亮度滑桿，將亮度範圍擴展至 -150% 至 1200%。<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ScqEWNE.gif\" alt=\"GIF showing the range of the new brightness slider\"></p>\n<p>最多可設定 5 個自訂亮度等級，並可透過 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mod Menu</a> 存取。<img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/43352940/122160522-15903a80-ce3e-11eb-86f0-daa53a3b4788.png\" alt=\"Image of 5 brightness levels in options\"></p>\n<p>遊戲內可設定快捷鍵來提高/降低亮度，或切換至特定亮度等級。<img src=\"https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/43352940/122161054-02ca3580-ce3f-11eb-81f3-1f623548b3fd.png\" alt=\"Image of the keybind selector\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Boosted_Brightness_Remastered/BH_Boosted_Brightness_Remastered_screenshots.webp\" alt=\"Screenshots\"> 洞穴亮度比較 <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/0e3v7rz.png\" alt=\"Comparison of several brightness levels in a cave\"></p>\n<p>夜間亮度比較 <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/jj6rp7y.png\" alt=\"Comparison of several brightness levels underwater\"></p>\n<p><strong>Video（＜1 分鐘）</strong> 缺少 v2 功能，但仍具實用性！</p>\n<p><span><span><span><span class=\"embed-removed\">已移除嵌入內容：<a href=\"https://elerium.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https%3a%2f%2fwww.youtube-nocookie.com%2fembed%2fKDiAw59KuTw\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/KDiAw59KuTw</a></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/Boosted_Brightness_Remastered/BH_Boosted_Brightness_Remastered_installation.webp\" alt=\"Installation\"></p>\n<ol>\n<li>安裝 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffabricmc.net%252fuse%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric</a></li>\n<li>將 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a> 的 jar 檔案放入 mods 資料夾</li>\n<li>將 Boosted Brightness 和 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/modmenu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mod Menu</a> 的 jar 檔案放入 mods 資料夾</li>\n</ol>\n<h2>相容性</h2>\n<p>與 Optifine 和 Sodium 相容。若發現任何相容性問題，請告知我。</p>\n<h2>授權條款</h2>\n<p>MIT。</p>\n<p><strong>專案支援與使用</strong></p>\n<p><strong>伺服器託管：</strong>為了獲得最佳效能，我建議使用橫幅中連結的 BisectHosting。</p>\n<p><strong>模組包：</strong>您可以自由將本模組納入任何模組包中。請務必透過提供此專案頁面的連結來給予適當的署名。</p>",
